  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "An option to upload (or select on avatar selection screen ingame) an avatar as a main fallback avatar that will ONLY be displayed to friends or to people that are added to a whitelist. Those avatars wont be visible to any other user in the instance and would work as a protective measure against rippers that steal avatars as they would not be able to view and cache the model. The whitelist option (alongside the friend only fallback) is for those who are not 100% sure if anyone from their big list of friends could potentially rip it and dont want to risk it being stolen.",
